[{"text": "We have heard the last speaker in the", "start": 0.32, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "general debate for this meeting. The", "start": 3.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "next plenary meeting to continue with", "start": 6.08, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "the general debate will be held", "start": 8.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "immediately following the adjournment of", "start": 10.639, "duration": 8.361}, {"text": "this me. The meeting is adjourned.", "start": 13.44, "duration": 5.56}, {"text": "The six plinary meeting of the general", "start": 23.439, "duration": 7.76}, {"text": "assembly is called to order.", "start": 26.32, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "The assembly will hear an address by his", "start": 35.44, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "excellency,", "start": 38.079, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "president of Mongolia.", "start": 40.8, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 42.96, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to to address", "start": 46.0, "duration": 6.92}, {"text": "the assembly.", "start": 49.44, "duration": 3.48}, {"text": "Mr. President, Mr. Secretary General,", "start": 68.24, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "distinguished delegates,", "start": 72.0, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 74.159, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "at the outset, I wish to extend my", "start": 76.479, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "sincere congratulations to Mr.", "start": 78.4, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Khalil Rahman on assuming the important", "start": 81.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "role of the president of the 81st", "start": 83.92, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "session of the United Nations General", "start": 86.0, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "Assembly and to convey my best wishes", "start": 87.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "for the successful session. This session", "start": 89.84, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "of the general assembly is convening on", "start": 92.24, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "the eve of the 65th anniversary of", "start": 94.24, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "Mongolia's full-fledged membership in", "start": 96.4, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "the United Nations.", "start": 98.479, "duration": 3.561}, {"text": "In 1961, Mongoya made history by raising", "start": 102.88, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "its national flag with the golden soybo", "start": 106.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "at the United Nations and becoming the", "start": 108.96, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "101st member of the United Nations, the", "start": 111.52, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "guaranter of global peace and security", "start": 114.479, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "and the beacon of hope and trust for the", "start": 117.119, "duration": 5.64}, {"text": "world's nations.", "start": 119.36, "duration": 3.399}, {"text": "Mongolia welcomes the convening of the", "start": 123.439, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "81st session of the United Nations", "start": 125.52, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "General Assembly under the theme", "start": 127.439, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "Restoring Trust, managing", "start": 129.44, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "transformation, a United Nations that", "start": 131.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "delivers for all, reaffirming its belief", "start": 133.36, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "in the central role of the United", "start": 136.0, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "Nations in fostering mutual trust,", "start": 137.68, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "mutual respect and cooperation among the", "start": 139.92, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "nations and peoples of the world.", "start": 142.0, "duration": 6.879}, {"text": "Mongols say if you do your best, fate", "start": 146.08, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "will do the rest. The United Nations is", "start": 148.879, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "an organization based on the trust and", "start": 151.92, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "commitment of each member state and the", "start": 154.239, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "UN is strengthened by their dedication", "start": 156.4, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "and sustained efforts. Therefore, it is", "start": 158.319, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "incumbent upon us member states to", "start": 160.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "uphold the mission of the United Nations", "start": 163.519, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "with a sincere heart rather than simply", "start": 165.519, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "expecting support and assistance. We", "start": 168.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "must remain deeply conscious of our own", "start": 170.48, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "responsibilities and duties and dedicate", "start": 172.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "our wholehearted efforts to", "start": 175.68, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "strengthening the United Nations. It is", "start": 177.519, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "through trust and hope, dedication and", "start": 179.76, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "commitment and engagement and", "start": 181.76, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "participation of every member state that", "start": 183.28, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "we can strengthen the United Nations. A", "start": 185.36, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "stronger United Nations in turn will", "start": 187.519, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "deliver more efficiently towards global", "start": 189.36, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "peace, security and sustainable", "start": 191.28, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "development, thereby creating conditions", "start": 193.12, "duration": 6.68}, {"text": "for all member states to benefit.", "start": 195.28, "duration": 4.52}, {"text": "As the conflicts and confrontations", "start": 199.84, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "flash across the world, the walls of", "start": 201.84, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "distrust rise higher and the chasm of", "start": 204.239, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "misunderstanding grows deeper. It is", "start": 206.879, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "becoming crucial to shape and develop", "start": 209.04, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "international relations not through a", "start": 211.2, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "form of multipolarity that risks", "start": 213.36, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "striving the world toward the vision but", "start": 215.84, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "through a multi-pillared principle that", "start": 218.08, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "respects the pluralism inherent in each", "start": 220.159, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "nation's history, culture, civilization,", "start": 222.72, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "core national interests and chosen path", "start": 225.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "of development.", "start": 227.92, "duration": 4.879}, {"text": "Eight centuries ago, our ancestors", "start": 230.56, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "established the great Pax Mongolica,", "start": 232.799, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "promoting for the first time the idea to", "start": 235.28, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the world that nations could mutually", "start": 237.519, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "recognize one another's values and that", "start": 239.68, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "peoples of diverse civilizations and", "start": 242.239, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "faiths could coexist.", "start": 244.4, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "This historic contribution of the", "start": 246.879, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "Mongols to the advancement of humankind", "start": 248.959, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "continues to be recognized by the", "start": 251.2, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "international community.", "start": 253.04, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "Let us strengthen multilateral", "start": 255.12, "duration": 3.519}, {"text": "cooperation through the multi-pillar", "start": 256.72, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "principle inspired by the ideas of Pax", "start": 258.639, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "Mongolica so that we may restore our", "start": 261.519, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "trust and hope through shared", "start": 264.4, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "responsibility, reform the United", "start": 265.919, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "Nations with a common purpose and build", "start": 268.08, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "a better, more peaceful world through", "start": 270.32, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the strength of our collective action.", "start": 272.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 274.88, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "despite the remarkable heights of", "start": 277.36, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "development and progress humanity has", "start": 279.28, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "reached, our planet is currently", "start": 281.28, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "confronted with more than 90 armed", "start": 283.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "conflicts, around 30 of which are", "start": 285.6, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "international, demonstrating that global", "start": 288.16, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "peace and security remain unstable and", "start": 290.4, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "that geopolitical and geostrategic", "start": 292.639, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "competition continues to intensify.", "start": 294.479, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "This results in the disruption of global", "start": 299.12, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "economic supply chains, a rise in the", "start": 301.36, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "prices of energy, fuel, raw materials,", "start": 304.4, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "and food, as well as economic strains on", "start": 307.52, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "nations around the world.", "start": 310.08, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "All of this is weakening the", "start": 313.919, "duration": 3.361}, {"text": "international order established since", "start": 315.44, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "the Second World War, changing the", "start": 317.28, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "universally recognized norms of", "start": 319.36, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "international law, and undermining the", "start": 321.28, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "stability of multilateral relations and", "start": 323.6, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 326.08, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "Magoya shares the view expressed by", "start": 328.96, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "United Nations Secretary General Antonio", "start": 331.039, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "Gutish in his annual report on the work", "start": 332.96, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "of the organization that in a world", "start": 335.36, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "marked by turbulence, division and", "start": 338.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "uncertainty, the United Nations is more", "start": 340.32, "duration": 7.08}, {"text": "necessary than ever.", "start": 343.36, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "Hence, Mongoya underscores the tangible", "start": 351.919, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "progress made under Secretary General's", "start": 354.479, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "UN80 initiative to improve the", "start": 357.199, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "effectiveness and efficiency of the", "start": 359.6, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "United Nations in response to the", "start": 361.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "challenges of our time and reaffirms its", "start": 363.52, "duration": 7.0}, {"text": "active support for this initiative.", "start": 366.08, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "The effectiveness of the United Nations,", "start": 374.24, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the decisiveness of its actions, and the", "start": 376.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "ability of nations to unite their", "start": 378.8, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "efforts will ultimately depend upon us,", "start": 380.88, "duration": 6.599}, {"text": "the member states.", "start": 383.84, "duration": 3.639}, {"text": "Mongolia is confident that the", "start": 388.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "soon-to-be appointed secretary general", "start": 389.919, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "will steadfastly uphold the principles", "start": 392.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "and purposes of the United Nations and", "start": 395.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "international law, ensure that the", "start": 397.84, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "voices and positions of all member", "start": 400.0, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "states are equally heard and reflected", "start": 402.24, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "and provide strong leadership in", "start": 404.639, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "restoring trust and man managing", "start": 406.4, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "transformation within the UN. Believing", "start": 408.479, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "that reform of the security council", "start": 410.96, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "should be at the core of broader United", "start": 412.8, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "Nations reform, Mongolia maintains its", "start": 414.72, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "principal position in support of", "start": 417.039, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "expanding the number of both permanent", "start": 418.8, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "and non-permanent members of the", "start": 420.88, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "security council, ensuring equitable", "start": 422.4, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "representation of developing countries", "start": 424.56, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "in the council and promoting greater", "start": 426.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "openness and transparency in its work.", "start": 428.4, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Mongolia is one of the 58 countries that", "start": 430.72, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "have never served as a non-permanent", "start": 433.44, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "member of the United Nations Security", "start": 435.52, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Council. Therefore, Mongoya aspires to", "start": 437.199, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "actively participate in the work of the", "start": 440.08, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "security council and contribute to", "start": 442.24, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "finding collective solutions to the", "start": 444.16, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "problems and challenges facing the", "start": 446.4, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "international community. In", "start": 448.319, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "manifestation of this aspiration, I", "start": 450.0, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "officially announce from this rostrm", "start": 452.319, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "today that Mongolia is representing its", "start": 454.479, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "candidature for a non-permanent seat of", "start": 457.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the UN Security Council for the term", "start": 459.599, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "2048 2049.", "start": 462.0, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Mr. President, on behalf of the people", "start": 464.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "of Mongolia, I extend my heartfelt", "start": 467.039, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "gratitude to the United Nations and its", "start": 469.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "system organizations for their valuable", "start": 471.44, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "contributions to our country's", "start": 474.0, "duration": 3.599}, {"text": "development and progress in their", "start": 475.599, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "long-standing constructive cooperation", "start": 477.599, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "over the 65 years since Mongolia's", "start": 479.759, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "succession to the United Nations as a", "start": 482.4, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "full-fledged member. Magoya has been", "start": 484.16, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "contributing with honor to the efforts", "start": 486.639, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "on strengthening international peace and", "start": 488.639, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "security, advancing social and economic", "start": 490.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "development, and protecting human", "start": 493.199, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "rights, the core pillars of the United", "start": 495.12, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "Nations.", "start": 497.36, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "For instance, more than three decades", "start": 502.72, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "ago, in pursuit of its foreign policy to", "start": 504.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "ensure national security through", "start": 507.28, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "political and diplomatic means, Mongolia", "start": 509.12, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "declared its territory nuclear", "start": 511.68, "duration": 5.159}, {"text": "weapon-free.", "start": 513.839, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Since then, Mongolia has consistently", "start": 517.279, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "pursued policies and taken actions to", "start": 519.76, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "verify the status legally. In this", "start": 522.56, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "spirit, the United Nations General", "start": 525.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Assembly adopts on a bianial basis the", "start": 527.519, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "resolution entitled Mongolia's", "start": 530.72, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "international security and nuclear", "start": 532.8, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "weapon free status initiated by Mongolia", "start": 534.64, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "in 1998.", "start": 537.44, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Furthermore, Mongolia has made tangible", "start": 539.6, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "contributions to global efforts to", "start": 542.08, "duration": 3.6}, {"text": "maintain international peace and", "start": 543.92, "duration": 3.359}, {"text": "security through its active", "start": 545.68, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "participation in the United Nations", "start": 547.279, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "peacekeeping operations and other", "start": 549.04, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "international missions, having deployed", "start": 551.12, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "more than 23,000 military and police", "start": 553.279, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "personnel to hotspots around the world", "start": 556.16, "duration": 5.359}, {"text": "since 2002.", "start": 558.32, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "Even today, our troops are serving in", "start": 561.519, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "the gang suppression force multinational", "start": 563.92, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "police and military mission deployed to", "start": 566.32, "duration": 5.24}, {"text": "Haiti.", "start": 568.56, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Mongolia has been actively advancing the", "start": 572.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "implementation of United Nations", "start": 574.64, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Security Council resolution 1325 women", "start": 576.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "peace and security and has become one of", "start": 580.0, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "the few countries to have reached 15%", "start": 582.24, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "women's participation and representation", "start": 585.04, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "among its military personnel serving in", "start": 587.92, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "UN POS", "start": 590.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "since 2006 when Mongolia deployed its", "start": 593.04, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "first female peacekeeper to the UN", "start": 596.56, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "mission in Western Sahara. A Mongolian", "start": 598.72, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "women have made valuable contributions", "start": 601.12, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "to global peace over the past two", "start": 602.959, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "decades through their courage,", "start": 605.04, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "resilience, and ingenuity. In this", "start": 606.959, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "connection, Mongolia plans to host the", "start": 609.519, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "second international conference on", "start": 611.76, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "women's participation in UN peacekeeping", "start": 613.44, "duration": 7.88}, {"text": "operations in Ulatar in 2027.", "start": 615.839, "duration": 5.481}, {"text": "I am pleased to highlight Mongolia's", "start": 623.68, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "active leadership within the United", "start": 625.839, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "Nations in advancing the interests of", "start": 627.519, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "landlock developing countries, drawing", "start": 629.36, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "greater international attention to their", "start": 631.519, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "special needs and unique circumstances", "start": 633.6, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "and cooperating with these countries to", "start": 636.16, "duration": 4.239}, {"text": "ensure that their voices are heard on", "start": 638.079, "duration": 6.041}, {"text": "the global stage.", "start": 640.399, "duration": 3.721}, {"text": "Mongolia has launched several important", "start": 648.64, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "initiatives in this regard, including", "start": 650.8, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "serving as one of the founding members", "start": 652.959, "duration": 3.281}, {"text": "of the group of landlock developing", "start": 654.56, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "countries at the United Nations and the", "start": 656.24, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "establishment of the international think", "start": 658.32, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "tank for landlock developing countries", "start": 660.0, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "in Olympar to translate the vasa program", "start": 661.68, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "of action into tangible outcomes. It is", "start": 664.64, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "essential for landlock developing", "start": 667.12, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "countries to align the program with", "start": 668.64, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "their national development agendas and", "start": 670.64, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "make full use of a of available", "start": 672.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "resources and opportunities to", "start": 674.48, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "accelerate regional integration and", "start": 676.72, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "cooperation. We also call upon the", "start": 679.279, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "international community, banks,", "start": 682.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "financial institutions and development", "start": 684.24, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "partners to provide credible assistance", "start": 686.399, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "to landlock developing countries through", "start": 688.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "their support and collaboration. Mr.", "start": 691.2, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "President,", "start": 693.92, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "as the deadline for the 2030 agenda for", "start": 696.16, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "sustainable development approaches, the", "start": 699.2, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "SDG report 2026 shows that only 36% of", "start": 701.76, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "the sustainable development goals are on", "start": 706.24, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "track or making moderate progress while", "start": 708.16, "duration": 7.119}, {"text": "15 progress 15% are regressing. It is", "start": 711.12, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "deeply regrettable that according to the", "start": 715.279, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "latest report of the Stockholm", "start": 717.519, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "International Peace Research Institute", "start": 719.2, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "released at this critical time, global", "start": 721.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "military expenditure has reached an", "start": 723.839, "duration": 8.12}, {"text": "all-time high of $2.9 trillion US.", "start": 725.92, "duration": 6.039}, {"text": "It is time for all of us to ponder and", "start": 732.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "reflect with common sense on what", "start": 734.88, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "progress could have been achieved in the", "start": 736.88, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "development of human society if this", "start": 738.56, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "huge budget and funds had been spent on", "start": 740.8, "duration": 4.159}, {"text": "tackling pressing issues such as", "start": 742.88, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "combating global warming and climate", "start": 744.959, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "change and improving education, health,", "start": 747.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "food security and advancement of women", "start": 750.0, "duration": 6.04}, {"text": "and children.", "start": 752.72, "duration": 3.32}, {"text": "According", "start": 757.2, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "to the SDG report 2026,", "start": 762.24, "duration": 7.279}, {"text": "Mongolia has achieved 68.8%", "start": 765.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "of the SGS, reflecting the tangible", "start": 769.519, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "results of our efforts and the progress", "start": 772.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "we have made in recent years.", "start": 774.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "As a country experiencing the adverse", "start": 778.0, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "impacts of climate change firsthand,", "start": 780.32, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Mongolia has remained steadfast in", "start": 782.56, "duration": 4.079}, {"text": "contributing to global collective", "start": 784.72, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "efforts to protect and preserve our", "start": 786.639, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "natural environment. In this regard,", "start": 789.04, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Mongoya is successfully implementing a", "start": 791.36, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "series of national policies and initi", "start": 793.92, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "initiatives including the billion trees,", "start": 795.92, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "food revolution, white gold, blue gold", "start": 798.72, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "and healthy Mongolian aimed at restoring", "start": 801.76, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "degraded land, expanding forest", "start": 804.16, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "resources, protecting soil, water and", "start": 806.32, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "pasture land, ensuring food supply and", "start": 809.2, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "security and supporting sustainable", "start": 811.519, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "rural development. Mongolia's billion", "start": 813.44, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "trees national movement goes far beyond", "start": 815.68, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "tree planting and aforestation. It is a", "start": 817.76, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "comprehensive nationwide initiative", "start": 820.32, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "aimed at combating desertification and", "start": 822.56, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "land degradation, scaling up land", "start": 824.8, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "restoration, expanding forest resources,", "start": 827.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "protecting soil fertility, water", "start": 829.92, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "resources and biodiversity, mitigating", "start": 831.92, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "the adverse impacts of climate change,", "start": 834.399, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "improving food supply, and creating", "start": 836.32, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "employment opportunities. Furthermore,", "start": 838.399, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "the United Nations General Assembly", "start": 840.56, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "resolution initiated by Mongolia", "start": 842.399, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "proclaiming 2026 as the international", "start": 844.56, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "year of rangeands and pastoralists", "start": 847.12, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "provides an opportunity to raise global", "start": 849.6, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "awareness of the importance of rangeand", "start": 852.079, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "ecosystems. Support the livelihoods of", "start": 854.32, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "pastoralists, strengthen sustainable", "start": 856.88, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "food systems, conserve biodiversity, and", "start": 859.04, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "preserve the cultural heritage of", "start": 862.16, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "nomadic peoples.", "start": 863.76, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "In this regard, Mongoya with its", "start": 866.079, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "millennia old tradition of nomadic", "start": 868.0, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "pastoralism took the initiative to", "start": 870.079, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "convene the global pastoralist gathering", "start": 872.32, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "and conference in Olymp. The gathering", "start": 874.48, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "brought together around 400 herders from", "start": 876.72, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "57 countries whose opinions and fruitful", "start": 879.76, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "discussion of challenges and solutions", "start": 882.639, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "culminated in the adoption of the olater", "start": 885.04, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "declaration. Moreover, in August,", "start": 887.68, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "Mongolia successfully hosted the 17th", "start": 890.48, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "session of the conference of the parties", "start": 892.959, "duration": 3.521}, {"text": "to the United Nations Convention to", "start": 894.72, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "Combat Desertification in Olatar under", "start": 896.48, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "the theme restoring land, restoring", "start": 899.279, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "hope. Restoring mother nature to its", "start": 901.36, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "pristine state and creating conditions", "start": 904.24, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "for future generations to live in a", "start": 906.079, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "healthy environment with confidence and", "start": 908.16, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "contentment must be a noble duty of", "start": 910.16, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "humanity.", "start": 912.72, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "Mother nature and healthy soil are the", "start": 914.56, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "guarantee of humanity's existence and", "start": 916.639, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "the foundation of food and water", "start": 918.959, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "resources, livelihood and sustainable", "start": 920.72, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "development.", "start": 923.199, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Healthy soil means healthy food and", "start": 925.04, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "healthy food means healthy people.", "start": 927.279, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "Therefore, desertification, land", "start": 930.079, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "degradation, and drought should not be", "start": 932.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "viewed merely as environmental issues,", "start": 934.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "but should be addressed holistically in", "start": 936.24, "duration": 3.839}, {"text": "connection with food supply and", "start": 938.24, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "security, water resources, livelihood,", "start": 940.079, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "sustainable development, and global", "start": 942.959, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "peace and security.", "start": 945.12, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "In this spirit, as the presidency of", "start": 948.24, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "UNCCCD COP 17, Mongolia has advanced the", "start": 950.48, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "step action agenda built upon three", "start": 953.759, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "interconnected flagship initiatives. the", "start": 956.399, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "Rangeland's flagship initiative, the", "start": 958.88, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "water land nexus initiative and the", "start": 961.279, "duration": 4.641}, {"text": "naturebased solutions for sustainable", "start": 963.519, "duration": 6.281}, {"text": "infrastructure initiative.", "start": 965.92, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "Particularly we regards the rangeands", "start": 971.759, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "flagship initiative as a landmark global", "start": 974.48, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "movement that opens a new chapter in the", "start": 977.199, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "history of rangeand conservation. This", "start": 979.6, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "initiative is special in raising global", "start": 982.079, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "awareness that the protection,", "start": 984.399, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "sustainable management and restoration", "start": 986.16, "duration": 3.679}, {"text": "of rangelands are of strategic", "start": 988.079, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "importance for building resilience to", "start": 989.839, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "climate change, ensuring food security", "start": 992.079, "duration": 7.081}, {"text": "and maintaining balanced ecosystems.", "start": 994.639, "duration": 4.521}, {"text": "The nomatic way of life that we Mongols", "start": 999.199, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "have inherited and carried forward over", "start": 1001.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "thousands of years embodies a", "start": 1004.0, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "comprehensive set of values and wisdom", "start": 1006.0, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "for living in harmony with nature and", "start": 1008.399, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "preserving it in its pristine state.", "start": 1010.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "Today we am Mongols aim to share with", "start": 1013.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "the world our cultural heritage and the", "start": 1015.519, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "traditional knowledge and experiences", "start": 1018.0, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "gained from living in harmony with", "start": 1020.0, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "nature thereby contributing to enhanced", "start": 1021.759, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "adaptation and resilience to climate", "start": 1024.4, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "change.", "start": 1026.799, "duration": 2.64}, {"text": "Mr. President,", "start": 1030.24, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "Mongoya consistently adheres to the", "start": 1033.12, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "principle of resolving any conflicts", "start": 1035.28, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "through diplomacy and multilateral", "start": 1037.439, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "dialogue while maintaining long-standing", "start": 1039.36, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "friendly relations with the countries of", "start": 1041.679, "duration": 4.0}, {"text": "the region.", "start": 1043.679, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Building on this distinctive advantage,", "start": 1045.679, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "Mongolia held the 11th international", "start": 1047.919, "duration": 4.401}, {"text": "conference of the Lambatar dialogue on", "start": 1050.08, "duration": 7.479}, {"text": "Northeast Asian security this year.", "start": 1052.32, "duration": 5.239}, {"text": "The Obamater dialogue has evolved into a", "start": 1058.48, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "unique platform for strengthening trust", "start": 1061.039, "duration": 4.801}, {"text": "and confidence building across Northeast", "start": 1063.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Asia, facilitating multilateral", "start": 1065.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "discussions among government delegates", "start": 1068.16, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "and scholars not only on traditional", "start": 1070.08, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "security challenges such as political", "start": 1072.32, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "and disarmament matters, but also on a", "start": 1074.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "broad range of issues including energy,", "start": 1076.799, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "infrastructure connectivity, green", "start": 1079.2, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "development, and humanitarian", "start": 1081.28, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "cooperation.", "start": 1082.96, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "Furthermore, as an active member of the", "start": 1084.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "United Nations, Mongolia has contributed", "start": 1086.72, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "to international cooperation to advance", "start": 1089.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "gender equality, strengthen women's", "start": 1091.84, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "political participation and leadership,", "start": 1094.16, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "and increase their representation at", "start": 1096.24, "duration": 6.28}, {"text": "decisionmaking levels.", "start": 1098.48, "duration": 4.04}, {"text": "In recent years, Mongolia has", "start": 1105.679, "duration": 3.761}, {"text": "established a tradition of hosting", "start": 1107.6, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "international events dedicated to women", "start": 1109.44, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "in our country, including the", "start": 1111.84, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "International Conference on", "start": 1113.919, "duration": 2.868}, {"text": "strengthening the role of women in", "start": 1115.2, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "[clears throat] peacekeeping in 2022,", "start": 1116.787, "duration": 3.933}, {"text": "the Female Foreign Ministers meeting in", "start": 1118.88, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "2023 and the World Women's Forum in 2024", "start": 1120.72, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "in collaboration with the United", "start": 1124.08, "duration": 3.36}, {"text": "Nations, and the World Women", "start": 1125.679, "duration": 6.201}, {"text": "Entrepreneurs Forum in 2025.", "start": 1127.44, "duration": 4.44}, {"text": "Hence, I am confident that the World", "start": 1134.0, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Women Parliamentarians Forum to be held", "start": 1136.0, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "in Oolatar on October 12 to 13 this year", "start": 1138.24, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "will substantially contribute to", "start": 1142.08, "duration": 3.12}, {"text": "strengthening women's political", "start": 1143.76, "duration": 3.68}, {"text": "leadership and interparliamentary", "start": 1145.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "cooperation, thereby advancing gender", "start": 1147.44, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "equality and accelerating progress", "start": 1150.0, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "towards achieving the sustainable", "start": 1152.64, "duration": 5.48}, {"text": "development goals.", "start": 1154.559, "duration": 3.561}, {"text": "I cordially invite you to participate in", "start": 1159.12, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "this important event at a high level and", "start": 1161.6, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "with broad representation. Magoya will", "start": 1163.84, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "continue to serve as a solid bridge for", "start": 1166.559, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "partnership, cooperation and solidarity", "start": 1168.88, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "in advancing women's social and", "start": 1171.679, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "political leadership and participation", "start": 1173.679, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "at all levels.", "start": 1176.0, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Mr. President", "start": 1178.16, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "Mongoya has consistently championed and", "start": 1180.72, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "supported numerous initiatives within", "start": 1183.28, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "the international community aimed at", "start": 1185.36, "duration": 3.92}, {"text": "preserving and promoting cultural", "start": 1187.6, "duration": 3.76}, {"text": "heritage, traditional knowledge, and the", "start": 1189.28, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "shared values of humanity. For instance,", "start": 1191.36, "duration": 5.679}, {"text": "in 2025 at Mongolia's initiative, a", "start": 1193.76, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "United Nations General Assembly", "start": 1197.039, "duration": 3.921}, {"text": "resolution proclaiming World Horse Day", "start": 1198.64, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "was adopted which recognizes the", "start": 1200.96, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "invaluable contribution of horses to the", "start": 1203.28, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "history, civilization, and socioeconomic", "start": 1205.52, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "development of peoples around the world.", "start": 1208.0, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "Moreover, last July, the cemetery", "start": 1210.24, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "complexes of the Hunu nobility,", "start": 1212.799, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Mongoya's first statehood, were", "start": 1215.2, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "inscribed on the UNESCO World Heritage", "start": 1217.039, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "list, reflecting international", "start": 1219.6, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "recognition of their historical and", "start": 1221.679, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "cultural significance. It is my pleasure", "start": 1223.84, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "to underline that Mongolia is serving", "start": 1226.16, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "for the first time as a member of the", "start": 1228.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "UNESCO World Heritage Committee for the", "start": 1230.24, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "term 2026 2029. Moreover, this year", "start": 1232.32, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "marks the 820th anniversary of the great", "start": 1236.32, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Mongol Empire, founded by Great", "start": 1239.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "Chingishan, men of the Millennium, King", "start": 1241.6, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "of Kings. The United Nations General", "start": 1244.0, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "Assembly resolution adopted on the", "start": 1246.24, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "occasion of the 800 years of Mongolian", "start": 1248.08, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "statethood highly values and emphasizes", "start": 1250.48, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "the contribution of Mongols to the", "start": 1252.96, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "history of humankind by recognizing the", "start": 1254.799, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "richness of nomatic civilization and its", "start": 1257.6, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "important contribution to promoting", "start": 1260.24, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "dialogue and interconnection among all", "start": 1262.0, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "forms of civilization and that nomatic", "start": 1264.32, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "civilization influenced interelia", "start": 1266.88, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "societies across Asia and Europe and in", "start": 1269.28, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "turn absorbed influences from both east", "start": 1272.159, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "and west and a true interchange of human", "start": 1274.88, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "values, the important role in the", "start": 1277.76, "duration": 3.919}, {"text": "development of extensive trade networks", "start": 1279.679, "duration": 3.281}, {"text": "and the creation of large", "start": 1281.679, "duration": 3.601}, {"text": "administrative, cultural, religious and", "start": 1282.96, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "commercial centers. This demonstrates", "start": 1285.28, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "that this historical contributions", "start": 1287.28, "duration": 3.759}, {"text": "embodied progressive ideas that could", "start": 1289.039, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "serve as a foundation for today's", "start": 1291.039, "duration": 3.841}, {"text": "collective efforts to safeguard peace", "start": 1293.12, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "and stability. For example, the renowned", "start": 1294.88, "duration": 5.919}, {"text": "Mongolist Vladislav Kotvich in his work,", "start": 1297.679, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Mongols are the promoters of the idea of", "start": 1300.799, "duration": 5.441}, {"text": "global peace from the early 14th century", "start": 1303.28, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "noted that Ultitang of the Mongol Empire", "start": 1306.24, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "in his letter sent to King Philip the", "start": 1309.76, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "forth of France in 1305 eloquently", "start": 1312.4, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "underscored the value of harmonious", "start": 1316.159, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "relations among nations and peoples in", "start": 1318.32, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "the thoughtful words, \"What could be", "start": 1320.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "better than true concord?", "start": 1323.039, "duration": 4.081}, {"text": "History is the foundation upon which we", "start": 1328.799, "duration": 4.961}, {"text": "reflect on the past, shape the present", "start": 1331.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "and build the future and is the memory", "start": 1333.76, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "of our statethood. Scholars advise that", "start": 1336.24, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "studying the establishment of Pax", "start": 1338.96, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "Mongolica by great Chingisan and his", "start": 1340.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "successors as well as the history of its", "start": 1343.52, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "foreign policy and diplomacy offers good", "start": 1345.919, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "practices and enduring lessons.", "start": 1348.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "Hence we the Mongol people who are", "start": 1352.559, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "guarding the sacred hearth of the great", "start": 1354.64, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "Mongol Empire wish to call upon from", "start": 1357.039, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "this mighty rostrm of the United Nations", "start": 1359.679, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "that if the nations of the world can", "start": 1362.159, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "bring together their efforts it is", "start": 1364.4, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "possible to establish a Pax Globala a", "start": 1366.559, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "global peace embodying the vision of the", "start": 1369.52, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "Pax Mongolica which eight centuries ago", "start": 1372.159, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "laid the foundation for nations to", "start": 1375.44, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "coexist in peace and humanity to", "start": 1377.679, "duration": 5.041}, {"text": "flourish. the role and contribution of", "start": 1380.0, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "the United Nations in further", "start": 1382.72, "duration": 3.439}, {"text": "strengthening mutual understanding,", "start": 1384.48, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "mutual trust and mutual respect among", "start": 1386.159, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "world nations and in fostering a", "start": 1388.32, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "peaceful world free from war and", "start": 1390.4, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "conflict where all can prosper together", "start": 1392.799, "duration": 4.481}, {"text": "are becoming increasingly critical than", "start": 1395.28, "duration": 4.399}, {"text": "ever. Therefore, let us work together to", "start": 1397.28, "duration": 4.32}, {"text": "empower the United Nations, the", "start": 1399.679, "duration": 4.161}, {"text": "guaranter of world peace and security", "start": 1401.6, "duration": 4.559}, {"text": "and a source of hope and trust for the", "start": 1403.84, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "nations of the world into a strong and", "start": 1406.159, "duration": 4.561}, {"text": "respected organization capable of", "start": 1408.4, "duration": 6.2}, {"text": "bringing Pax Globala.", "start": 1410.72, "duration": 3.88}, {"text": "May the eternal blue sky bless humankind", "start": 1417.039, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "forever with peace across the world.", "start": 1419.679, "duration": 7.161}, {"text": "Thank you for your attention.", "start": 1423.12, "duration": 3.72}, {"text": "On behalf of this assembly, I wish thank", "start": 1433.84, "duration": 6.44}, {"text": "the president of Mongolia", "start": 1436.4, "duration": 3.88}]